---
config:
  flowchart:
    nodeSpacing: 120
    rankSpacing: 160
  themeVariables:
    fontSize: 18px
    padding: 50
    edgeLabelBackground: 'transparent'
---
flowchart TD
    %% actors
    Vigilo["fa:fa-terminal <br/> <b>Vigilo CLI</b> <br/> <small>[Container: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Starts the coordinator loop or one-shot cycle.</small>"]:::component
    Worker["fa:fa-gear <br/> <b>Worker</b> <br/> <small>[Container: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Consumes chunk-ready events and persists execution outcomes.</small>"]:::component

    %% components
    CommandFacade["fa:fa-compass <br/> <b>Coordinator Command Facade</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust / Clap]</small> <br/> <small>Selects start or once mode, loads throughput knobs, and creates a coordinator identity.</small>"]:::component
    ServiceLoop["fa:fa-rotate <br/> <b>Service Loop Runner</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust / Tokio]</small> <br/> <small>Runs coordinator cycles on a fixed tick and handles shutdown.</small>"]:::component
    RuntimeContext["fa:fa-layer-group <br/> <b>Runtime Context Access</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Provides database and messaging clients for each cycle.</small>"]:::component

    CycleOrchestrator["fa:fa-arrows-spin <br/> <b>Coordinator Cycle Orchestrator</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Runs lease recovery, dispatch, finalization, outbox publication, and structured timing logs in deterministic order.</small>"]:::component
    LeaseRecovery["fa:fa-life-ring <br/> <b>Chunk Lease Recovery</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust / SQLx]</small> <br/> <small>Recovers expired chunk leases or marks poison chunks failed after the recovery limit.</small>"]:::component
    DispatchDrainer["fa:fa-list-check <br/> <b>Dispatch Batch Drainer</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Bounds chunk-window dispatch work and logs cursor backlog per coordinator cycle.</small>"]:::component
    DispatchWorkflow["fa:fa-share-nodes <br/> <b>Run Dispatch Workflow</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust / SQLx]</small> <br/> <small>Claims control cursors, prepares execution snapshots, and inserts bounded run.chunk.ready windows.</small>"]:::component

    FinalizeDrainer["fa:fa-flag-checkered <br/> <b>Finalization Batch Drainer</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust]</small> <br/> <small>Bounds finalizable-run work and logs candidate backlog per coordinator cycle.</small>"]:::component
    FinalizeWorkflow["fa:fa-calculator <br/> <b>Run Finalization Workflow</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust / SQLx]</small> <br/> <small>Reads routed shard summaries, sets global gate status, and inserts run.completed events.</small>"]:::component

    OutboxPublisher["fa:fa-paper-plane <br/> <b>Outbox Publisher</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust / Tokio]</small> <br/> <small>Claims delivery batches, logs per-placement backlog, publishes with bounded concurrency, and deletes completed rows.</small>"]:::component
    EventPublisher["fa:fa-plug <br/> <b>Event Publisher Boundary</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust Trait]</small> <br/> <small>Separates durable outbox handling from the broker transport.</small>"]:::component
    MqPublisher["fa:fa-envelope-open-text <br/> <b>RabbitMQ Event Publisher</b> <br/> <small>[Component: Rust / AMQP]</small> <br/> <small>Declares durable topology and publishes persistent mandatory JSON events with confirms.</small>"]:::component

    %% coordinator boundary
    subgraph CoordinatorRuntime["&nbsp;"]
        CommandFacade
        ServiceLoop
        RuntimeContext
        CycleOrchestrator
        LeaseRecovery
        DispatchDrainer
        DispatchWorkflow
        FinalizeDrainer
        FinalizeWorkflow
        OutboxPublisher
        EventPublisher
        MqPublisher
    end
    style CoordinatorRuntime stroke-dasharray: 5 5,fill:none,stroke:#1168bd,stroke-width:2px

    %% external containers
    Database[("<b>Database Placements</b> <br/> <small>[Container: PostgreSQL]</small> <br/> <small>Store control cursors, routed execution rows, shard summaries, local outbox events, and delivery queues.</small>")]:::component
    Queue[("<b>Queue</b> <br/> <small>[Container: RabbitMQ]</small> <br/> <small>Durably stores routed run lifecycle and chunk-ready events.</small>")]:::component

    %% edges
    Vigilo -->|"Runs coordinator start or once through"| CommandFacade
    CommandFacade -->|"Starts continuous mode with"| ServiceLoop
    CommandFacade -->|"Runs one cycle through"| CycleOrchestrator
    ServiceLoop -->|"Invokes on each tick"| CycleOrchestrator

    CycleOrchestrator -->|"Acquires clients from"| RuntimeContext
    RuntimeContext -->|"Opens database access to <br> <small>[SQL/TCP]</small>"| Database
    RuntimeContext -->|"Opens messaging access to <br> <small>[AMQP]</small>"| Queue

    CycleOrchestrator -->|"First recovers"| LeaseRecovery
    LeaseRecovery -->|"Resets expired leases, inserts recovery events, or fails exhausted chunks in <br> <small>[SQL/TCP]</small>"| Database

    CycleOrchestrator -->|"Then drains"| DispatchDrainer
    DispatchDrainer -->|"Claims one dispatchable run window with"| DispatchWorkflow
    DispatchWorkflow -->|"Claims one control cursor, then updates execution-local chunks, snapshots, outbox events, and delivery rows in <br> <small>[SQL/TCP]</small>"| Database

    CycleOrchestrator -->|"Then finalizes"| FinalizeDrainer
    FinalizeDrainer -->|"Claims and finalizes one terminal run at a time with"| FinalizeWorkflow
    FinalizeWorkflow -->|"Reads routed shard summaries and updates the control run summary in <br> <small>[SQL/TCP]</small>"| Database

    CycleOrchestrator -->|"Finally publishes with"| OutboxPublisher
    OutboxPublisher -->|"Claims delivery rows, marks ledgers, deletes completed rows, and reschedules retries in <br> <small>[SQL/TCP]</small>"| Database
    OutboxPublisher -->|"Publishes claimed events concurrently through"| EventPublisher
    EventPublisher -->|"Uses AMQP transport"| MqPublisher
    MqPublisher -->|"Publishes persistent routed run events to <br> <small>[JSON/AMQP]</small>"| Queue
    Queue -->|"Streams run.chunk.ready events to"| Worker

